      <description>&lt;h3 id=&#34;status&#34;&gt;Status&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;Experimental&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;Prototype&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;overview&#34;&gt;Overview&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Personal computational biology experiments evaluating deep learning-based cell segmentation tools (Cellpose) for the quantitative analysis of confocal and fluorescence microscopy images.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;technical-scope&#34;&gt;Technical Scope&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Python and Cellpose&lt;/strong&gt;: Evaluation of pre-trained cell segmentation models on confocal microscopy images.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Image Processing&lt;/strong&gt;: Batch feature extraction (cell area, signal intensity, cell count).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jupyter Notebooks&lt;/strong&gt;: Exploratory pipelines for data analysis and visualization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;focus&#34;&gt;Focus&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Evaluating segmentation accuracy and automating cell counting workflows for bioimaging datasets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;















